Bug E1: Zombie villager curing does nothing
Files: `pumpkin/src/net/java/play.rs`, `entity/mob/zombie/zombie_villager.rs`
What is wrong: Right-clicking any zombie villager with a golden apple grants the
Zombie Doctor advancement immediately. No Weakness check, no timer, no 
conversion.
Verified vanilla behaviour: Requires the Weakness effect, then converts over a 
randomised timer, with a visible shaking state, preserving profession and 
trades.
The change to make: Implement properly; grant the advancement on completion, not
on click.
Be careful: Look for existing conversion machinery first (zombie to drowned, pig
to zombified piglin). The cure trade discount depends on gossip, which is in 
someone else's open PR #2408 — do not build gossip.

Make the smallest change that fixes exactly this. Do not touch unrelated code. 
When done, run `cargo build -p pumpkin` and make sure it compiles, then stop. Do
not commit.

